d", "measure": "1", "value": "Violin 1"}, {"type": "key", "measure": "1", "value": "G major"}]}, {"start_measure": "0", "end_measure": "3", "headline": "Second violin plays the theme lower", "text": "The main theme also shows up in the second violin in the same bars [m. 0-3]. It sits 12 semitones lower, which is one octave down. Listen for the same tune underneath the top line.", "focus_part": "Violin 2", "claims": [{"type": "theme", "measure": "0", "value": "Violin 2"}]}, {"start_measure": "7", "end_measure": "8", "headline": "Tune over accompaniment, then separate lines", "text": "At [m. 7] a melody sits on top with the others accompanying. At [m. 8] the parts go their own ways. This is called independent lines.", "focus_part": "all", "claims": [{"type": "texture", "measure": "7", "value": "melody + accompaniment"}, {"type": "texture", "measure": "8", "value": "independent lines"}]}, {"start_measure": "9", "end_measure": "11", "headline": "The melody steps forward again", "text": "The upper line is again the tune, with the rest accompanying. The lead is probably the first violin.", "focus_part": "Violin 1", "claims": [{"type": "texture", "measure": "9", "value": "melody + accompaniment"}, {"type": "lead", "measure": "9", "value": "Violin 1"}]}, {"start_measure": "12", "end_measure": "14", "headline": "The analysis marks the busiest point", "text": "The parts join in block chords again. The analysis marks measure 12 as the loudest or busiest point, but that is a computer estimate. Bars 13 and 14 are in G major.", "focus_part": "all", "claims": [{"type": "climax", "measure": "12", "value": "Part 1"}, {"type": "texture", "measure": "12", "value": "homophonic"}, {"type": "key", "measure": "13", "value": "G major"}]}, {"start_measure": "15", "end_measure": "16", "headline": "The music turns to D major", "text": "At [m. 15] the key changes to D major. This is an estimate. The tune is over accompaniment. By [m. 16] the first violin is clearly the lead. Part 1 ends here and is repeated.", "focus_part": "Violin 1", "claims": [{"type": "modulation", "measure": "15", "value": "D major"}, {"type": "texture", "measure": "15", "value": "melody + accompaniment"}, {"type": "lead", "measure": "16", "value": "Violin 1"}]}, {"start_measure": "17", "end_measure": "22", "headline": "The Trio begins with a clear violin tune", "text": "A new section, the Trio, starts at [m. 17]. It stays in D major. The first violin clearly has the tune and the others accompany.", "focus_part": "Violin 1", "claims": [{"type": "section", "measure": "17", "value": "Trio"}, {"type": "key", "measure": "17", "value": "D major"}, {"type": "lead", "measure": "17", "value": "Violin 1"}, {"type": "texture", "measure": "17", "value": "melody + accompaniment"}]}, {"start_measure": "23", "end_measure": "23", "headline": "A brief block-chord moment", "text": "For one bar the parts move together in block chords. Then the tune returns above an accompaniment at [m. 24].", "focus_part": "all", "claims": [{"type": "texture", "measure": "23", "value": "homophonic"}, {"type": "texture", "measure": "24", "value": "melody + accompaniment"}]}, {"start_measure": "25", "end_measure": "28", "headline": "The lead becomes less clear", "text": "The lead is probably the first violin in [m. 25-27], with the others accompanying. At [m. 28] the two violins share the lead. The lines are independent there.", "focus_part": "Violin 1", "claims": [{"type": "texture", "measure": "25", "value": "melody + accompaniment"}, {"type": "lead", "measure": "25", "value": "Violin 1"}, {"type": "texture", "measure": "28", "value": "independent lines"}, {"type": "lead", "measure": "28", "value": "Violin 1"}, {"type": "lead", "measure": "28", "value": "Violin 2"}]}, {"start_measure": "29", "end_measure": "34", "headline": "The first violin leads clearly again", "text": "At [m. 29] the first violin again clearly leads, with accompaniment. The estimated chords repeat those of [m. 17-22]. It sounds like the Trio's opening idea coming back.", "focus_part": "Violin 1", "claims": [{"type": "lead", "measure": "29", "value": "Violin 1"}, {"type": "texture", "measure": "29", "value": "melody + accompaniment"}, {"type": "key", "measure": "29", "value": "D major"}]}, {"start_measure": "35", "end_measure": "36", "headline": "Block chords close the movement", "text": "The last two bars are homophonic. At the very end the lead is shared between the first violin and the cello, and this is uncertain. The estimated final chord is D major. The Trio is repeated.", "focus_part": "all", "claims": [{"type": "texture", "measure": "35", "value": "homophonic"}, {"type": "lead", "measure": "36", "value": "Violin 1"}, {"type": "lead", "measure": "36", "value": "Cello"}, {"type": "key", "measure": "36", "value": "D major"}]}], "glossary": [{"term": "Unison/octaves", "explanation": "Instruments play the same notes, possibly in different registers."}, {"term": "Homophonic", "explanation": "All parts move together in the same rhythm, like block chords."}, {"term": "Melody + accompaniment", "explanation": "One part has the tune and the others support it."}, {"term": "Independent lines", "explanation": "Each part follows its own path at the same time."}, {"term": "Key", "explanation": "The home note and scale that the music feels centered on."}, {"term": "Trio", "explanation": "The second main section of this movement."}, {"term": "Theme", "explanation": "A tune you can recognize when it returns."}, {"term": "Octave", "explanation": "The same note name, higher or lower. It is 12 semitones away."}]}, "zh": {"title": "莫扎特《小夜曲》K. 525 第三乐章 小步舞曲(Allegretto)听赏指南", "overview": "这是一首3/4拍的小步舞曲,由第一小提琴、第二小提琴、中提琴和大提琴演奏。本乐章分为两大部分:第一部分(Part 1)和Trio,两部分都要反复。主调是G大调,从第15小节起转到D大调。第一小提琴大多数时候带领旋律。请注意:调性与和弦都是软件自动估计的,可能有误。", "overview_claims": [{"type": "key", "measure": "0", "value": "G major"}, {"type": "section", "measure": "0", "value": "Part 1"}, {"type": "section", "measure": "17", "value": "Trio"}, {"type": "key", "measure": "15", "value": "D major"}, {"type": "lead", "measure": "0", "value": "Vn1"}], "listening_points": [{"start_measure": "0", "end_measure": "3", "headline": "第一小提琴奏出主旋律", "text": "本乐章一开始,各声部以齐奏或八度进入[m. 0]。第一小提琴奏出主旋律[m. 0-3]。旋律从D5出发。第二小提琴也在低八度处奏出同一旋律[m. 0-3]。", "focus_part": "Violin 1", "claims": [{"type": "texture", "measure": "0", "value": "unison/octaves"}, {"type": "theme", "measure": "0", "value": "Violin 1"}, {"type": "theme", "measure": "0", "value": "Violin 2"}]}, {"start_measure": "1", "end_measure": "6", "headline": "主调织体:声部同步行进", "text": "接下来几个小节是主调织体[m. 1-6]。主调织体指各声部节奏大体一致,像一起奏和弦。这一段调性是G大调。分析没有标出任何强弱记号,所以力度没有明显变化。", "focus_part": "all", "claims": [{"type": "texture", "measure": "1", "value": "homophonic"}, {"type": "key", "measure": "1", "value": "G major"}, {"type": "dynamic", "measure": "1", "value": "unmarked"}]}, {"start_measure": "7", "end_measure": "8", "headline": "织体变化:先伴奏,后各自独立", "text": "第7小节是旋律加伴奏,其他声部为旋律作衬托[m. 7]。第8小节变成独立声部,几条线各走各的[m. 8]。这里领奏的判断不太确定,可能仍是第一小提琴。", "focus_part": "Violin 1", "claims": [{"type": "texture", "measure": "7", "value": "melody + accompaniment"}, {"type": "texture", "measure": "8", "value": "independent lines"}]}, {"start_measure": "9", "end_measure": "11", "headline": "旋律在上,其他声部伴奏", "text": "这三小节是旋律加伴奏[m. 9-11]。第一小提琴大概在领奏,但把握不大。", "focus_part": "Violin 1", "claims": [{"type": "texture", "measure": "9", "value": "melody + accompaniment"}]}, {"start_measure": "12", "end_measure": "14", "headline": "分析标出的最响最忙处", "text": "软件分析把第12小节标为本乐章最响、最忙的位置[m. 12]。但乐谱上没有力度记号。这里是主调织体,一直延续到第14小节[m. 12-14]。调性仍是G大调。", "focus_part": "all", "claims": [{"type": "climax", "measure": "12", "value": "Part 1"}, {"type": "texture", "measure": "12", "value": "homophonic"}, {"type": "key", "measure": "14", "value": "G major"}]}, {"start_measure": "15", "end_measure": "16", "headline": "转入D大调,第一部分结束", "text": "从第15小节起,调性转到D大调[m. 15]。第16小节第一小提琴领奏的把握很高[m. 16]。第一部分到此结束,并且要反复。", "focus_part": "Violin 1", "claims": [{"type": "modulation", "measure": "15", "value": "D major"}, {"type": "key", "measure": "15", "value": "D major"}, {"type": "lead", "measure": "16", "value": "Vn1"}, {"type": "texture", "measure": "16", "value": "melody + accompaniment"}]}, {"start_measure": "17", "end_measure": "22", "headline": "Trio开始:第一小提琴清晰领奏", "text": "Trio从第17小节开始[m. 17]。调性是D大调。第一小提琴领奏的把握很高,其他声部伴奏[m. 17-22]。旋律清楚,容易跟着听。", "focus_part": "Violin 1", "claims": [{"type": "section", "measure": "17", "value": "Trio"}, {"type": "key", "measure": "17", "value": "D major"}, {"type": "lead", "measure": "17", "value": "Vn1"}, {"type": "texture", "measure": "17", "value": "melody + accompaniment"}]}, {"start_measure": "23", "end_measure": "23", "headline": "短暂的主调织体", "text": "第23小节变成主调织体,各声部节奏更一致[m. 23]。领奏的把握较低。", "focus_part": "all", "claims": [{"type": "texture", "measure": "23", "value": "homophonic"}]}, {"start_measure": "24", "end_measure": "27", "headline": "旋律加伴奏", "text": "这一段又是旋律加伴奏[m. 24-27]。第一小提琴大概在领奏,但把握不高。", "focus_part": "Violin 1", "claims": [{"type": "texture", "measure": "24", "value": "melody + accompaniment"}]}, {"start_measure": "28", "end_measure": "28", "headline": "领奏可能由两把小提琴共享", "text": "第28小节是独立声部[m. 28]。领奏可能由第一、第二小提琴共享,把握很低。听的时候,可以留意两把小提琴如何交替。", "focus_part": "all", "claims": [{"type": "texture", "measure": "28", "value": "independent lines"}]}, {"start_measure": "29", "end_measure": "34", "headline": "清晰的旋律再次出现", "text": "第29至34小节,第一小提琴再次明确领奏,其他声部伴奏[m. 29-34]。和弦估计与第17至22小节相同。你会有熟悉的感觉。", "focus_part": "Violin 1", "claims": [{"type": "texture", "measure": "29", "value": "melody + accompaniment"}, {"type": "lead", "measure": "29", "value": "Vn1"}, {"type": "key", "measure": "29", "value": "D major"}]}, {"start_measure": "35", "end_measure": "36", "headline": "主调织体收尾,落在D大调", "text": "最后两小节是主调织体[m. 35-36]。调性是D大调。末尾的领奏可能由第一小提琴和大提琴共享,把握很低。Trio在D大调和弦上结束。", "focus_part": "all", "claims": [{"type": "texture", "measure": "35", "value": "homophonic"}, {"type": "key", "measure": "36", "value": "D major"}]}], "glossary": [{"term": "小步舞曲", "explanation": "一种3/4拍的舞曲,每小节三拍。"}, {"term": "Trio", "explanation": "本乐章的第二大部分,从第17小节开始。"}, {"term": "转调", "explanation": "音乐的中心调从一个调换到另一个调,色彩会随之变化。"}, {"term": "主调织体", "explanation": "各声部节奏大体一致,像一起奏和弦。"}, {"term": "旋律加伴奏", "explanation": "一个声部奏主旋律,其他声部在下面衬托。"}, {"term": "独立声部", "explanation": "几条旋律线各自进行,互不一致。"}, {"term": "齐奏/八度", "explanation": "几个声部奏相同的音,或相差八度的同一个音。"}]}}, "verification": {"en": {"verified": 40, "failed": 0, "unchecked": 0, "failures": [], "removed_points": 0, "before_removal": {"verified": 40, "failed": 0, "unchecked": 0}, "prose_issues": []}, "zh": {"verified": 33, "failed": 0, "unchecked": 0, "failures": [], "removed_points": 0, "before_removal": {"verified": 33, "failed": 0, "unchecked": 0}, "prose_issues": []}}, "score_quality": {"verdict": "good", "share_wrong_length": 0.0}, "alignment": {"audio": "../../audio/IMSLP324337-PMLP05176-mozart_kv525_afarcry.mp3", "order": "all_repeats+dc_repeats", "order_description": "every repeat taken, then Da Capo with the repeat(s) at 8, 16", "sound_end_sec": 839.0, "warnings": ["Two repeat patterns fit almost equally well; check whether the performers took the repeats.", "1 measure(s) matched poorly and should be checked by ear: 0"], "clip_offset_sec": 0.0, "measures": [{"occurrence": 0, "mc": 1, "label": "0", "start_sec": 704.563, "end_sec": 704.941, "flagged": false, "tempo_qpm": 158.7}, {"occurrence": 1, "mc": 2, "label": "1", "start_sec": 704.941, "end_sec": 706.119, "flagged": false, "tempo_qpm": 152.8}, {"occurrence": 2, "mc": 3, "label": "2", "start_sec": 706.119, "end_sec": 707.25, "flagged": false, "tempo_qpm": 159.2}, {"occurrence": 3, "mc": 4, "label": "3", "start_sec": 707.25, "end_sec": 708.382, "flagged": false, "tempo_qpm": 159.0}, {"occurrence": 4, "mc": 5, "label": "4", "start_sec": 708.382, "end_sec": 709.607, "flagged": false, "tempo_qpm": 146.9}, {"occurrence": 5, "mc": 6, "label": "5", "start_sec": 709.607, "end_sec": 710.692, "flagged": false, "tempo_qpm": 165.9}, {"occurrence"